    "created_at": "2020-12-05T05:01:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-05T05:01:00Z",
    "body": "I am going to close this issue because the underlying reason for this request was to detect a condition which was triggered by an implementation bug. In the current API the `readable` and `writable` attributes will be non-null if the port is opened.",
