    "created_at": "2023-07-01T18:40:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-01T18:40:14Z",
    "body": "Figuring out how to handle the case where a device is open for exclusive access by another document goes beyond the question of adding an `isOpen()` method. `USBDevice`, for example, has an `opened` attribute but it only reflects the state of the current document.",
